// The same query as ../allocation_by_year.dax on the hidden plain (naive) form of the measure, so that before and after run the same query.
// Slow measure 3, plain form, shaped like a matrix: the Allocated Amount of the Cabinet Office administration pool by financial year,
// eight years.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year],
    "allocated", [Allocated Amount (naive)]
)
ORDER BY 'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year]
